  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A diffraction grating has <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> number of lines per unit length. When monochromatic light of wavelength 600 nm is incident on the grating, the third-order maximum is observed at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> to the straight-through direction. </p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sin \\theta\"></span>?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0 \\times 10^{-7} \\times M^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0 \\times 10^{-7} \\times M\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.8 \\times 10^{-6} \\times M^{-1}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.8 \\times 10^{-6} \\times M\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
